&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your first 30 days, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn RADAR&#39;s platform, technology, deployment model, and commercial landscape well enough to speak to it credibly with retail executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get up to speed on the current pipeline, existing relationships, and active deals in flight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begin building relationships with key stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Marketing, and Deployment Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your first 60 days, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a defined set of target accounts and have active conversations underway with new and existing prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a clear, accurate view of your pipeline in the CRM, with next steps and timing mapped for each opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begin representing RADAR externally at meetings, calls, or events with prospective retail partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your first 90 days, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have moved multiple targets meaningfully forward in the pipeline, with at least one opportunity in active negotiation or pilot planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be recognized internally as the owner of your accounts and externally as a trusted point of contact for your retail partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be delivering regular, reliable pipeline and forecast visibility to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At RADAR, your base pay is one part of your total compensation package. The expected base salary range for this position is $150,000–$190,000, with an on-target earnings (OTE) range of $250,000–$320,000 inclusive of variable compensation. Individual pay is determined by work location and additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. You will also be eligible to receive other benefits including: equity, comprehensive medical and dental coverage, life and disability benefits, 401(k) plan, flexible time off, and paid parental leave. The pay range listed for this position is a good faith and reasonable estimate of the range of possible base compensation at the time of posting.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
