&lt;li&gt;Diverse Perspectives: We believe better ideas come from diverse backgrounds, experiences, and viewpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathy-Driven Design: We build with deep respect for our end users, listening closely to their feedback and needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The HR Business Partner will partner closely with leaders across the organization, with a focus on Commercial, Customer, and Corporate Operations to scale our people programs, improve performance management, and drive talent development. You’ll help strengthen leadership capability, solve complex people challenges, and ensure our teams are supported with the programs and tools they need to do their best work. This role is ideal for someone who excels at both strategy and execution, thrives in fast-paced environments, and is comfortable building and improving processes as the company grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
