&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience designing in environments with hardware or other physical systems&lt;/li&gt;
