&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Manager, Strategic Operations to bridge the gap between executive vision and ground-level execution. This role brings discipline and structure to how RADAR plans, prioritizes, and delivers on its most critical initiatives, while surfacing the cross-functional themes and operational signals that matter most as we scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with all teams, including Finance, Product, Go To Market, Engineering, Customer and Legal teams, to gather insights, align stakeholders, move complex projects forward and propose solutions.&amp;nbsp; This role blends analytical thinking with hands-on execution.&amp;nbsp; You will be a key member of the team that shapes the way RADAR operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
